  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-02T19:55:04.316Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now, VRC_Pickup and OnInteract display exactly the same outline highlight when hovering over them. This is often confusing, as unless the Interaction Text clearly indicates what the object in question does, you have no idea if you are going to activate something or pick it up. I recommend changing the color of one the outlines so that these two systems are distinct.\n\nExample:\nVRC_Pickup = Blue\nOnInteract = Green",
